<html lang="ro" dir="ltr" class="" style=""><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"><meta name="og-profile-acct" content="gyorgymelissza@gmail.com"><script type="text/javascript" async="" src="./icon-192_files/js" nonce=""></script><!--<base href="https://gemini.google.com/">--><base href="."><link rel="preconnect" href="https://www.gstatic.com/"><meta name="referrer" content="origin"><meta name="viewport" content="initial-scale=1,minimum-scale=1,width=device-width,interactive-widget=resizes-content,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="color-scheme" content="only"><meta name="google-site-verification" content="NDfDvTdbFxsd1TbRRZVQZULBTRT2-fatyuQ1TT8gack"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Gemini"><meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"><meta name="application-name" content="Gemini"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Gemini"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black"><meta name="msapplication-tap-highlight" content="no"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://gemini.gstatic.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://www.google.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://waa-pa.clients6.google.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://ogads-pa.clients6.google.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://www.gstatic.com/"><link rel="manifest" crossorigin="use-credentials" href="https://gemini.google.com/_/BardChatUi/manifest.json"><link rel="home" href="https://gemini.google.com/?lfhs=2"><link rel="msapplication-starturl" href="https://gemini.google.com/?lfhs=2"><link rel="icon" href="https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/gemini_sparkle_4g_512_lt_f94943af3be039176192d.png" sizes="512x512"><link rel="apple-touch-icon-precomposed" href="https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/gemini_sparkle_4g_512_lt_f94943af3be039176192d.png" sizes="512x512"><link rel="msapplication-square512x512logo" href="https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/gemini_sparkle_4g_512_lt_f94943af3be039176192d.png" sizes="512x512"><link rel="preload" href="./icon-192_files/m=_b" as="script" nonce=""><script data-id="_gd" nonce="">window.WIZ_global_data = {"AEJOSc":false,"ARR9x":true,"AfY8Hf":false,"Ajsvkd":true,"B7TsWc":"","BdA8rf":true,"CVUPx":false,"DEh2U":false,"DedwT":true,"Di4zjc":false,"DnVkpd":"Ajută-mă să mă pregătesc pentru o excursie cu cortul. Călătoresc cu familia și plănuim să pescuim și să privim stelele.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/ro/d1_9237588f2fa88c5ad6375.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/ro/da1_2b0ad300edc62bc7c8e7a.jpg∞Iată câteva sfaturi pentru o excursie cu cortul cu familia:\n- Alege un loc potrivit, cu acces la apă și întunecat noaptea.\n- Fă-ți o listă cu lucrurile de care ai nevoie, inclusiv cort, saci de dormit, saltele, unelte pentru pescuit, lanternă, trusă de prim ajutor, hrană și apă, îmbrăcăminte și încălțăminte confortabilă, protecție solară și insectifug.\n- Planifică-ți activitățile, cum ar fi drumeții, înot, bălăceală, picnic sau jocuri de societate.\n- Verifică prognoza meteo și adu haine și încălțăminte impermeabile.\n- Distrează-te!\n∰Creează o listă de cumpărături pentru o prăjitură cu ciocolată.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/ro/d2_e57417f952ca07d698efe.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/ro/da2_2b0ad300edc62bc7c8e7a.jpg∞Iată o listă de cumpărături pentru o prăjitură cu ciocolată, bazată pe o rețetă simplă de foi fragede și cremă de ciocolată:\nIngrediente:\nPentru aluat:\n500 g făină\n250 g unt\n125 g zahăr\n4 gălbenușuri\n1 zahăr vanilat\nPentru cremă:\n250 ml lapte\n1 plic praf de budincă\n250 g unt\n100 g zahăr\n100 g ciocolată rasă\nPentru glazură:\n100 g ciocolată de menaj\n50 g unt\nOpțional:\nzahăr pudră\nfructe de pădure\nbezea\n∰Creează o listă cu 5 cărți științifico-fantastice cunoscute și prezintă rezultatele într-un tabel cu descrieri.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/ro/d3_85f3d34e8c84862711ae3.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/ro/da3_5ff1d933c0f46d02b12b0.jpg∞Iată o listă cu 5 cărți științifico-fantastice cunoscute, prezentate într-un tabel cu descrieri:\n\u003ctable\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth\u003eTitlu\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eAutor\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eAnul publicării\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eGen\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eTemă\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e","DpimGf":false,"ENrkEf":0,"EOzIkf":"7lY4X1L-ynY","EP1ykd":["/_/*","/calling-opt-out","/calling-opt-out/*","/corp","/corp/*","/corp2","/corp2/*","/drivesharing","/drivesharing/*","/emulator","/emulator/*","/staging","/staging/*"],"FABJ3e":"https://docs.google.com/picker","FL1an":false,"FdrFJe":"-8187687124307898500","GK6dn":"https://geminiweb-pa.clients6.google.com","GdU5Bf":"","GtQXDc":"Give me caption options to tell the world about my new fur baby, Finn. Use emojis∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/m1_02050367fdbe8690faba4.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/ma1_21f7d57cc2164a94180f6.png∞Sure, here are some caption options to tell the world about your new fur baby, Finn, using emojis:\n🐶 Meet my new best friend, Finn! He’s a bundle of joy and I can’t wait for all the adventures we’ll have together. #newpuppy #furryfriend #Finn\n🐾 Finn has stolen my heart! He’s the cutest and cuddliest puppy I’ve ever met. #puppylove #FinnFan #doglover\n🐕‍🦺 Finn is officially part of the family! He’s already brought so much joy into our lives. #welcomehomeFinn #adoptdontshop #dogsofinstagram\n🐶 Finn is my little shadow! He follows me everywhere I go. #puptastic #FinnAdventures #dogdays\n🐾 Finn is always up for a good cuddle! He’s the perfect lapdog. #snugglebuddy #FinnTheCuddleBug #bestdoggoever∰Describe a new fashion trend that’s inspired by retro styles.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/m2_0837b565aa77b98938d28.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/ma2_4dc50c5a1ccf43229c150.png∞New fashion trend inspired by retro styles:\nThe Neo-Glam Revival\nThe Neo-Glam Revival is a new fashion trend that takes inspiration from the glamorous styles of the 1970s and 1980s. This trend is all about bold colors, metallics, and over-the-top silhouettes.\nSome of the key pieces of the Neo-Glam Revival include:\nSequin dresses: Sequin dresses are a must-have for anyone who wants to channel the Neo-Glam Revival trend. These dresses are perfect for a night out on the town, and they’ll make you feel like a million bucks.\nMetallic suits: Metallic suits are another key piece of the Neo-Glam Revival trend. These suits are perfect for making a statement, and they can be dressed up or down depending on the occasion.∰Draft a guide on how to set up the perfect movie marathon night with friends.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/m3_d4e89a863f2a97bd080a7.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/ma3_45eebba09a87a8a8c95e6.png∞How to Set Up the Perfect Movie Marathon Night with Friends\nMovie marathons are a great way to spend time with friends and enjoy your favorite films. But to make sure your marathon is a success, there are a few things you need to do to prepare.\n1. Choose your movies\nThe most important thing is to choose movies that everyone will enjoy. If you’re not sure what to pick, try doing a poll of your friends to see what they’re interested in. You can also choose a theme for your marathon, such as all comedies, all horror movies, or all movies from a particular decade.\n2. Set a schedule\nOnce you’ve chosen your movies, it’s a good idea to set a schedule for the night. This will help ensure that you have enough time to watch all of the movies and also take breaks for snacks and bathroom visits.","HUGLxb":"https://geminiweb-pa.clients6.google.com","HiPsbb":1,"I2uq4c":"","Im6cmf":"/_/BardChatUi","IrULFb":"","J1jtEd":5,"JLbhgf":"https://notebooklm.google.com","JNl6me":"/punctual/prod/assistant-bard","KnDnFf":"feeds/nrij2vo2gajxiu","L8cmRe":" ","LoQv7e":false,"LtiLwc":true,"Lz8rbb":true,"ML1cTc":false,"MT7f9b":[],"MUE6Ne":"gemini-web-uiserver","MuJWjd":false,"P1qjVc":false,"PI9WOb":"CAMSsAYVrAHM2swNqASxpNAFsCq9A-UC9QSJBoEEoA-uD9K6-Q7T9QXrArfeuxeewvoD4SyT9NwG2QXN7wam_AQ-sHm-S4sF06IGo9cG5aMFQrXABog75PMFzssM3BramgaXBc9VlluObQPYZ6dU9gm7E7ISpADg3wajUTqoWaYGmtgGpUqcPoxIn8UGCOVi1zjojQbKBjCnI_AXsF7MQ_eaBt0euxaKBG7tALFMsSyLFBSfPrI2uz7xkQbcFFLaC-YR8y3dSyaBEph83RqpGsuqBqFRxxLMtgbjFJ8FzCi4LsdNnB2PD6fD0wbY3p4GntdHggulRsJCnCailgOKAr06cONInG6IftcWpR2OsAbe0wXJC5uOBt4EBakXqUTkALoL-i7EArQCA9wduqYFwZoGw5oFPt2LBte3BvEbzwOyRg8DyxmEE-QN_F7sM4ZDhzT3BI47thMrhD_wPQPwWvM3gxPE-QbwJqEG6S3qEqQz0gi-JAMDkAKtC_UqiCmvOvwpiBmqcZp0AwOuZYADBNYBsUzNCIUhviSeGb12AwNhjQLNDQMDI8oDAwP5EzwDA-YZsATJBAPeI062Aqk48TrFaMsxqyREA_t9zBuRJNgGA9kC_wMDAwMDuB6_BIoE8AWPMtFVyAC_AMklA4cKygmYAcwaRAMDAwOHEOEFwkurCYc3ogwDA4IA0wCXG-If-zvDCvsswRfeNokWrAqeGcQFCY4ZlAbQI_xM5IUG2yyoPwMDpCzsIQO9CZcM7Ry88wbhFbohhSCMJeIy0Qjldx7MDY5iA-sGogvJAdlhrzINiRHCzwanJS2GCdot_E-GCoMVBAQEzwaODKQkzQWJCdsKrSf8AfsBxRShAt8BA4gFkw6-FsAS_kOuDa8FgRwDAYcR5UPsA4tshRKhRtQFkT7sU8k26yS0LK4n9hHGHJMb2gK1UagC1wa7A5gC9AKrK8UPtCDoiQZz6y7GRqET_U-PLbFCrj-VBb4Oas0O0h4D7gv3DpMRlA13AwMDAwMDA-U-uSenDqkY9TgD5gyUCPMcvS6UBATIxwa4ycACptcqwOAqpYgLpbMW78JMhNQpieoGHQc\u003d","QrtxK":"0","RAQcW":true,"RL9Dob":["poate crea o mâncare din: conopidă, castraveți și iaurt","îți poate explica dacă fulgerul poate lovi de două ori în același loc","poate rezuma un video scurt de 30 de secunde care prezintă orașul tău","poate găsi câteva modalități care să te ajute să citești mai mult anul acesta","poate explica dacă calitatea 