onse-container-header-status ng-tns-c3774178123-20"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c3774178123-20"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-20" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3774178123-20 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3774178123-20"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c622123267="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini a spus</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c2168670771=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2168670771="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c452521089="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" _nghost-ng-c2993282806="" id="message-content-id-r_a2eccf4b9ba62e44" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2993282806="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_a2eccf4b9ba62e44" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">Pentru a transforma site-ul într-o aplicație reală (Progressive Web App - PWA) care rulează pe tot ecranul telefonului, fără bara browserului, trebuie să adaugi trei elemente simple în folderul proiectului tău.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Aceste setări vor personaliza aplicația direct pentru departament, oferindu-i un aspect profesional pe telefoanele electricienilor.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">Pasul 1: Creează fișierul <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="26">manifest.json</code></h3><p data-path-to-node="3">Acest fișier îi spune telefonului cum să afișeze aplicația (numele, culorile și iconița). Creează un fișier nou cu numele <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="122">manifest.json</code> în același folder cu <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="157">index.html</code> și adaugă următorul cod:</p><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3786462746="" class="ng-tns-c3786462746-31 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="code-block ng-tns-c3786462746-31 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9hMmVjY2Y0YjliYTYyZTQ0IiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY182NGI1MmE1YTkxNzRjYmM3IixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMV1d" style="display: block;" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahcKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQdQ"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c3786462746-31"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c3786462746-31"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c3786462746-31 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="ng-tns-c3786462746-31">JSON</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="buttons ng-tn