iv _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="ng-tns-c3774178123-54 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-54"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c3774178123-54"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c3774178123-54"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-54" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3774178123-54 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3774178123-54"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c622123267="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini a spus</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c2168670771=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2168670771="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c452521089="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" _nghost-ng-c2993282806="" id="message-content-id-r_4f2d7d880ec8c8d1" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2993282806="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_4f2d7d880ec8c8d1" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" style="--animation-duration: 660ms;"><span>Crearea acestor chei înseamnă,</span><span> practic,</span><span> să deschizi un „sertar” digital gratuit pe serverele Google (Firebase).</span><span class=""> Cheile sunt doar adresa și parola prin care fișierul tău </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="169">index.html</code><span> știe unde să trimită cantitățile adăugate sau extrase.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="1"><span>Iată exact pe ce trebuie să dai click:</span></p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">1. Cum FACI cheile (În Firebase)</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3" class="md-has-block-component"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><span>Intră pe </span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><link-block _nghost-ng-c3985753499="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><a _ngcontent-ng-c3985753499="" target="_blank" rel="noopener" externallink="" _nghost-ng-c740770960="" jslog="197247;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80ZjJkN2Q4ODBlYzhjOGQxIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY184NmEzOWVlNzVkOGVlMTdmIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" href="https://console.firebase.google.com/" class="ng-star-inserted" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQogI">console.firebase.google.com</a><!----></link-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><span> și loghează-te cu un cont Google.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><span>Apasă pe </span><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">Create a project</b><span> (sau </span><i data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="31">Add project</i><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><span>La nume,</span><span> scrie </span><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="15">Magazie PRAM</b><span> și apasă </span><i data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="37">Continue</i><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,3,0"><span>Te va întreba de </span><i data-path-to-node="3,3,0" data-index-in-node="17">Google Analytics</i><span>.</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="3,3,0" data-index-in-node="35">Debifează-l</b><span> (dezactivează butonul albastru) pentru că nu ai nevoie,</span><span> apoi apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="3,3,0" data-index-in-node="114">Create project</b><span>.</span><span> Așteaptă 10 secunde să se configureze,</span><span> apoi apasă </span><i data-path-to-node="3,3,0" data-index-in-node="180">Continue</i><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,4,0"><span>Acum ești în panoul principal.</span><span> Pe centrul ecranului scrie </span><i data-path-to-node="3,4,0" data-index-in-node="58">„Get started by adding Firebase to your app”</i><span>.</span><span> Sub acest text sunt niște iconițe rotunde.</span><span> Apasă pe </span><b data-path-to-node="3,4,0" data-index-in-node="156">iconița de Web</b><span> (cea care arată fix așa:</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="3,4,0" data-index-in-node="196" class=""><code data-path-to-node="3,4,0" data-index-in-node="196">&lt;/&gt;</code></b><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,5,0"><span>Scrie un nume (ex:</span><span> </span><i data-path-to-node="3,5,0" data-index-in-node="19">Magazie Web</i><span>) și apasă butonul albastru </span><b data-path-to-node="3,5,0" data-index-in-node="58">Register app</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,6,0"><span>Acum îți va apărea pe ecran un cod.</span><span> Copiază </span><b data-path-to-node="3,6,0" data-index-in-node="44">doar blocul care conține cheile</b><span>,</span><span> cel care arată cam așa:</span></p><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3786462746="" class="ng-tns-c3786462746-55 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="code-block ng-tns-c3786462746-55 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80ZjJkN2Q4ODBlYzhjOGQxIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY184NmEzOWVlNzVkOGVlMTdmIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQowI" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c3786462746-55"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c3786462746-55"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c3786462746-55 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="ng-tns-c3786462746-55">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="buttons ng-tns-c3786462746-55 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Descarcă codul" gemtooltip="Descarcă codul" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c3786462746-55 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2527649141="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-28" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2527649141="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Descarcă codul" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2527649141="" _nghost-ng-c24212812=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c24212812="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copiază codul" gemtooltip="Copiază codul" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c3786462746-55 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2527649141="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-29" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2527649141="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copiază codul" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80ZjJkN2Q4ODBlYzhjOGQxIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY184NmEzOWVlNzVkOGVlMTdmIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2527649141="" _nghost-ng-c24212812=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c24212812="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" class="ng-tns-c3786462746-55"><code _ngcontent-ng-c3786462746="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c3786462746-55"><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> firebaseConfig = {
  <span class="hljs-attr">apiKey</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"AIzaSy..."</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">authDomain</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"magazie-pram-....firebaseapp.com"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">projectId</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"magazie-pram-..."</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">storageBucket</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"magazie-pram-....appspot.com"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">messagingSenderId</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"123..."</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">appId</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"1:123..."</span>
};
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="4">2. Cum Pui cheile în codul tău</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><span>Deschide fișierul tău </span><code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="22">index.html</code><span> în editor (vscode.</span><span>dev sau Notepad).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><span>Derulează în jos,</span><span> aproape de final,</span><span> până găsești comentariul:</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="62">// 2. MODIFICĂ AICI: DATELE TALE FIREBASE</code><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,2,0"><span>Șterge vechiul bloc </span><code data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="20">const firebaseConfig = { ... };</code><span> care avea valorile mele false (gen "AICI_PUI_API_KEY").</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,3,0"><span>Lipește (Paste) blocul tău real copiat la pasul anterior.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,4,0"><span>Salvează fișierul (Ctrl + S).</span></p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="6">3. Cum pornești efectiv baza de date (Tot în Firebase)</h3><p data-path-to-node="7"><span>Acum codul tău știe adresa,</span><span> dar trebuie să îi descuiem ușa să poată scrie în ea.</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><span>Întoarce-te în pagina de Firebase de adineauri și apasă pe butonul </span><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="67">Continue to console</b><span> pentru a închide fereastra cu codul.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><span>În meniul din partea stângă a ecranului,</span><span> dă click pe secțiunea </span><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="63">Build</b><span>,</span><span> apoi selectează </span><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="86">Firestore Database</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,2,0"><span>Apasă pe butonul </span><b data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="17">Create database</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,3,0"><span>Va apărea o fereastră cu reguli de securitate.</span><span> Selectează </span><b data-path-to-node="8,3,0" data-index-in-node="58">Start in test mode</b><span> (Pornire în modul de testare).</span><span> </span><i data-path-to-node="8,3,0" data-index-in-node="108">Asta e crucial pentru ca aplicația să îi lase pe electricieni să modifice datele fără să ceară o parolă de logare.</i><span> Apasă </span><i data-path-to-node="8,3,0" data-index-in-node="229">Next</i><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,4,0"><span>La locație,</span><span> alege </span><b data-path-to-node="8,4,0" data-index-in-node="18">eur3 (europe-west)</b><span> pentru ca serverul să fie fizic în Europa (se va mișca mai repede) și apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="8,4,0" data-index-in-node="113">Enable</b><span>.</span></p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="10">Mai ai ceva de făcut în afară de acești pași?</h3><p data-path-to-node="11"><span>Da,</span><span> au mai rămas fix </span><b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="21">două lucruri</b><span> de făcut după ce ai salvat </span><code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="61">index.html</code><span> cu cheile corecte:</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Să urci fișierele pe internet (pe GitHub):</b><span> Acum fișierele sunt doar la tine în calculator.</span><span> Prin crearea unui cont gratuit pe GitHub și încărcarea folderului acolo (funcția GitHub Pages),</span><span> vei obține link-ul oficial al aplicației (ex:</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="233">[https://numeletau.github.io/magazie](https://numeletau.github.io/magazie)</code><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Codul QR:</b><span> Iei acel link generat de GitHub,</span><span> îl pui într-un generator gratuit de coduri QR de pe internet,</span><span> îi dai print pe o foaie și îl lipești în magazie.</span></p></li></ol><div class="attachment-container unknown md-has-block-component"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><follow-up _nghost-ng-c543247246="" class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543247246="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="follow-up-container hide-from-message-actions"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543247246="" class="follow-up-text gds-headline-s">Vrei să urcăm fișierele pe GitHub acum?</div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543247246="" class="follow-up-button-container"><button _ngcontent-ng-c543247246="" class="follow-up-button lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" jslog="270376;track:generic_click"><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c543247246="" fonticonname="prompt_suggestion" size="small" _nghost-ng-c24212812=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c24212812="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-s lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="prompt_suggestion" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="prompt_suggestion"></mat-icon><!----><!----><