" _nghost-ng-c1188584280="" class="enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280=""><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c3774178123="" class="ng-tns-c3774178123-71 reduced-bottom-padding enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates enable-luminous-sources ng-star-inserted" jslog="188576;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl82NjY0NDk3NjlmMDI4M2JiIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQoMELahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQzQM"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container response-container-with-gpi ng-tns-c3774178123-71 no-background" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="1"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c3774178123-71 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c3774178123-71"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="ng-tns-c3774178123-71 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-71"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c3774178123-71"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c3774178123-71"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-71" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3774178123-71 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3774178123-71"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c622123267="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini a spus</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c2168670771=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2168670771="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c452521089="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" _nghost-ng-c2993282806="" id="message-content-id-r_666449769f0283bb" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2993282806="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_666449769f0283bb" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">1. Crearea proiectului pe GitHub</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="1"><li><p data-path-to-node="1,0,0"><span>Intră pe </span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><link-block _nghost-ng-c3985753499="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><a _ngcontent-ng-c3985753499="" target="_blank" rel="noopener" externallink="" _nghost-ng-c740770960="" jslog="197247;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl82NjY0NDk3NjlmMDI4M2JiIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY184YTU0MDZkYWVmYmJkMDUzIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" href="https://github.com/" class="ng-star-inserted" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ0wM">github.com</a><!----></link-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><span> și creează-ți un cont gratuit (sau loghează-te dacă ai deja unul).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><span>Apasă pe butonul verde </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="23">New</b><span> din stânga paginii (sau pe iconița </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="62">+</b><span> din dreapta sus -&gt; </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="83">New repository</b><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="1,2,0"><span>La </span><i data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="3">Repository name</i><span>,</span><span> scrie </span><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="26">magazie-pram</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="1,3,0"><span>Asigură-te că este bifată opțiunea </span><b data-path-to-node="1,3,0" data-index-in-node="35">Public</b><span> și apasă butonul verde </span><b data-path-to-node="1,3,0" data-index-in-node="65">Create repository</b><span> din josul paginii.</span></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="2"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0">2. Încărcarea fișierelor</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><span>Pe ecranul următor,</span><span> sub titlul care conține cuvântul </span><i data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="53">code</i><span>,</span><span> dă click pe textul albastru </span><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="87">uploading an existing file</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><span>Deschide folderul de pe calculatorul tău și trage (drag and drop) toate cele 5 fișiere (</span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="88">index.html</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="100">manifest.json</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="115">sw.js</code><span> și cele două imagini </span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="142">icon-192.png</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="156">icon-512.png</code><span>) în chenarul de pe site.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><span>Așteaptă câteva secunde să se încarce,</span><span> apoi apasă butonul verde </span><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="64">Commit changes</b><span>.</span></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="4"><b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="0">3. Generarea link-ului (GitHub Pages)</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><span>În meniul orizontal de sus,</span><span> sub numele proiectului,</span><span> apasă pe tab-ul </span><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="68">Settings</b><span> (marcat cu o rotiță dințată).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><span>Din meniul vertical din partea stângă,</span><span> derulează în jos și dă click pe </span><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="71">Pages</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,2,0"><span>La secțiunea </span><i data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="13">Build and deployment</i><span>,</span><span> sub opțiunea </span><i data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="48">Branch</i><span>,</span><span> apasă pe meniul derulant unde scrie </span><b data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="92">None</b><span>,</span><span> selectează </span><b data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="109">main</b><span> și apasă butonul </span><b data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="131">Save</b><span>.</span></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="6"><span>Activarea link-ului durează aproximativ 2-3 minute.</span><span> După acest timp,</span><span> dă un refresh paginii (F5),</span><span> iar în partea de sus va apărea un mesaj care confirmă că site-ul este live,</span><span> alături de adresa URL a aplicației (de forma </span><code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="218">[https://numele-tau.github.io/magazie-pram/](https://numele-tau.github.io/magazie-pram/)</code><span>).</span><span> Copiază acel link,</span><span> lipește-l într-un generator online de coduri QR și printează imaginea rezultată.</span></p></div></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="response-footer gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c3733613330="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c446528241="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c4215747216="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class