><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3855608089="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3855608089="" _nghost-ng-c859782377="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Vezi detaliile sursei pentru referința bibliografică din PNG: image_891a1e.png. Apasă pe Enter pentru a deschide caseta de dialog cu surse." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiQQ"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">PNG</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="1"><span>Sunt două mici încurcături acolo:</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0" id="p-rc_f2da0a518f632774-24"><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,0">În meniul din stânga te afli pe secțiunea „Source Control” (iconița cu puncte legate), în loc să fii pe „Explorer” (prima iconiță, cea cu două fișiere suprapuse), motiv pentru care nu îți vezi corect folderul</span><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,2">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3855608089="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3855608089="" _nghost-ng-c859782377="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Vezi detaliile sursei pentru referința bibliografică din PNG: image_891a1e.png. Apasă pe Enter pentru a deschide caseta de dialog cu surse." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQigQ"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">PNG</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0" id="p-rc_f2da0a518f632774-25"><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,0" class="">Ai lipit codul HTML într-un fișier text denumit <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="48">Magazie PRAM.txt</code> (acesta este tab-ul deschis și activ acum pe ecran)</span><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,2" class="">. Sus se observă că ai deschis și tab-urile corecte (<code data-path-to-node="2,1,0,2" data-index-in-node="53">index.html</code>, <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0,2" data-index-in-node="65">manifest.json</code>, <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0,2" data-index-in-node="80">sw.js</code>), dar probabil sunt goale sau blocate</span><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,3" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,4">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3855608089="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3855608089="" _nghost-ng-c859782377="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Vezi detaliile sursei pentru referințele bibliografice din PNG: image_891a1e.png și PNG: image_891a1e.png. Apasă pe Enter pentru a deschide caseta de dialog cu surse." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiwQ"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">PNG</span><span _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-count ng-star-inserted">+ 1</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="3"><span>Deoarece browserul te blochează și nu îți dă permisiuni de salvare pe calculator,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="82">vom ocoli complet această problemă</b><span>.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="4"><span>Cel mai simplu și rapid este să asamblăm fișierele </span><b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="51">direct pe GitHub</b><span>,</span><span> cu Copy-Paste.</span><span> Astfel,</span><span> scapi de orice bătaie de cap cu fișierele locale.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="5"><span>Uite pașii exacți pentru a face asta direct pe internet:</span></p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">Pasul 1: Crearea proiectului pe GitHub</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><span>Intră pe </span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><link-block _nghost-ng-c3985753499="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><a _ngcontent-ng-c3985753499="" target="_blank" rel="noopener" externallink="" _nghost-ng-c740770960="" jslog="197247;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9kZmE1NmM2Mjk1MjkzNTEwIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY19mMmRhMGE1MThmNjMyNzc0IixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" href="https://github.com/" class="ng-star-inserted" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ7gM">github.com</a><!----></link-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><span> și creează un cont gratuit (sau loghează-te).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><span>Apasă butonul verde </span><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="20">New</b><span> (sau iconița </span><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="37">+</b><span> din dreapta sus -&gt; </span><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="58">New repository</b><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><span>La </span><i data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="3">Repository name</i><span> scrie </span><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="25">magazie-pram</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,3,0"><span>Lasă bifat </span><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="11">Public</b><span> și apasă butonul verde </span><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="41">Create repository</b><span>.</span></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="8"><b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="0">Pasul 2: Crearea fișierelor direct din browser (Copy-Paste)</b><span>
În loc să încarci fișiere din calculator,</span><span> le vom crea scriind textul direct pe site-ul lor:</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><span>Pe ecranul care îți apare după crearea proiectului,</span><span> apasă pe textul albastru </span><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="77">creating a new file</b><span> (sau butonul </span><i data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="110">Add file</i><span> -&gt; </span><i data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="122">Create new file</i><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><span>La numele fișierului (în căsuța de sus),</span><span> scrie exact </span><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="53" class=""><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="53">index.html</code></b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,2,0" id="p-rc_f2da0a518f632774-26"><span data-path-to-node="9,2,0,0" class="">Mergi înapoi în fereastra ta cu <i data-path-to-node="9,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="32">vscode.dev</i>, dă click în acel tab <code data-path-to-node="9,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="65">Magazie PRAM.txt</code></span><span data-path-to-node="9,2,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="9,2,0,2" class="">, apasă <code data-path-to-node="9,2,0,2" data-index-in-node="8">Ctrl + A</code> (pentru a selecta tot) și <code data-path-to-node="9,2,0,2" data-index-in-node="43">Ctrl + C</code> (pentru a copia tot codul tău, care are deja cheile Firebase puse).</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3855608089="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3855608089="" _nghost-ng-c859782377="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Vezi detaliile sursei pentru referința bibliografică din PNG: image_891a1e.png. Apasă pe Enter pentru a deschide caseta de dialog cu surse." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQjAQ"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">PNG</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,3,0"><span>Întoarce-te pe GitHub,</span><span> dă click în spațiul mare și gol și apasă </span><code data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="64">Ctrl + V</code><span> (Paste).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,4,0"><span>Apasă butonul verde din dreapta sus </span><b data-path-to-node="9,4,0" data-index-in-node="36">Commit changes</b><span> (apoi încă o dată pe butonul de confirmare).</span></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="10"><b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0">Pasul 3: Adăugarea restului de fișiere</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"><span>Acum ești pe pagina principală a magaziei tale.</span><span> Apasă butonul </span><b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="62">Add file</b><span> -&gt; </span><b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="74">Create new file</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><span>Numește-l </span><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="10" class=""><code data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="10">manifest.json</code></b><span>.</span><span> Lipește codul pentru manifest pe care ți l-am dat mai devreme și apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="96">Commit changes</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,2,0"><span>Apasă iar </span><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="10">Add file</b><span> -&gt; </span><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="22">Create new file</b><span>.</span><span> Numește-l </span><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="49" class=""><code data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="49">sw.js</code></b><span>,</span><span> lipește cele 4 rânduri de cod pentru el și apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="105">Commit changes</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,3,0"><span>Pentru cele două imagini (iconițele descărcate de tine pe calculator):</span><span> apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="77">Add file</b><span> -&gt; </span><b data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="89">Upload files</b><span>.</span><span> Trage pozele în chenar și apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="135">Commit changes</b><span>.</span></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="12"><b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">Pasul 4: Activarea link-ului (Ultimul pas!)</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="13"><li><p data-path-to-node="13,0,0"><span>Sub numele proiectului tău,</span><span> apasă pe tab-ul </span><b data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="44">Settings</b><span> (rotița dințată).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,1,0"><span>Din meniul din stânga,</span><span> alege </span><b data-path-to-node="13,1,0" data-index-in-node="29">Pages</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,2,0"><span>La secțiunea </span><i data-path-to-node="13,2,0" data-index-in-node="13">Branch</i><span>,</span><span> schimbă din </span><i data-path-to-node="13,2,0" data-index-in-node="33">None</i><span> în </span><b data-path-to-node="13,2,0" data-index-in-node="41">main</b><span> și apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="13,2,0" data-index-in-node="55">Save</b><span>.</span></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="14"><span>Așteaptă fix 2 minute,</span><span> dă un refresh la pagină,</span><span> iar sus îți va apărea link-ul oficial al aplicației tale.</span><span> Acel link îl bagi într-un generator de cod QR și ai terminat!</span></p></div></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="response-footer has-thoughts gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c3733613330="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c446528241="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c4215747216="" clas