77" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3774178123-77 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3774178123-77"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c622123267="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini a spus</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c2168670771=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2168670771="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c452521089="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" _nghost-ng-c2993282806="" id="message-content-id-r_8b8399975db74adc" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2993282806="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_8b8399975db74adc" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" id="p-rc_07d86c817d7d7266-28"><span data-path-to-node="0,0">Nu, ești în secțiunea greșită. Imaginea arată că te afli în secțiunea „Projects” (Proiecte), care este folosită pentru organizarea sarcinilor</span><span data-path-to-node="0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2">. Pentru a pune codul aplicației pe internet, trebuie să creezi un „Repository” (Depozit de cod).</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3855608089="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3855608089="" _nghost-ng-c859782377="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Vezi detaliile sursei pentru referința bibliografică din PNG: image_8924ed.png. Apasă pe Enter pentru a deschide caseta de dialog cu surse." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAQ"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">PNG</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="1"><span>Iată cum ajungi unde trebuie:</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0" id="p-rc_07d86c817d7d7266-29"><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,0">Apasă pe iconița GitHub din colțul stânga-sus (lângă cele trei linii) pentru a te întoarce pe pagina principală</span><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="2,0,0,2">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3855608089="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3855608089="" _nghost-ng-c859782377="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Vezi detaliile sursei pentru referința bibliografică din PNG: image_8924ed.png. Apasă pe Enter pentru a deschide caseta de dialog cu surse." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsQQ"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c859782377="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">PNG</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0" id="p-rc_07d86c817d7d7266-30"><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,0" class="">Apasă pe semnul <b data-path-to-node="2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="16">"+"</b> din colțul din dreapta-sus și selectează <b data-path-to-node="2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="61">New repository</b> din meniul care apare</span><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2173203612="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2173203612="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="2,1,0,2">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3855608089="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ng