onse _ngcontent-ng-c4124302847="" _nghost-ng-c1188584280="" class="enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280=""><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c3774178123="" class="ng-tns-c3774178123-80 reduced-bottom-padding enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates enable-luminous-sources ng-star-inserted" jslog="188576;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8yYjhiYmJiYTVhNGRiYjcyIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQoMELahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQvAQ"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container response-container-with-gpi ng-tns-c3774178123-80 no-background" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="1"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c3774178123-80 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c3774178123-80"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="ng-tns-c3774178123-80 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-80"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c3774178123-80"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c3774178123-80"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-80" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3774178123-80 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3774178123-80"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c622123267="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini a spus</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c2168670771=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2168670771="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c452521089="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" _nghost-ng-c2993282806="" id="message-content-id-r_2b8bbbba5a4dbb72" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2993282806="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_2b8bbbba5a4dbb72" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><span>Este perfect,</span><span> nu trebuie neapărat să fie adunate într-un folder.</span><span> Dacă le ai direct pe Desktop,</span><span> le putem încărca foarte ușor.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="1"><span>Iată cum le pui pe GitHub:</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><span>Pe pagina depozitului tău nou creat (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="37">magazie-pram</code><span>),</span><span> apasă pe textul albastru </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="77">uploading an existing file</b><span> (se află chiar sub titlul care conține cuvântul </span><i data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="152">code</i><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><span>Pe ecran va apărea un chenar mare.</span><span> Apasă pe textul </span><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="51">choose your files</b><span> din acel chenar.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><span>Se va deschide o fereastră de Windows.</span><span> Mergi în stânga la </span><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="58">Desktop</b><span>,</span><span> selectează cele 5 fișiere (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="94">index.html</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="106">manifest.json</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="121">sw.js</code><span> și cele două imagini) și apasă </span><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="158">Open</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,3,0"><span>Așteaptă câteva secunde până vezi că toate cele 5 fișiere apar listate pe ecran.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,4,0"><span>Derulează puțin mai jos și apasă butonul verde </span><b data-path-to-node="2,4,0" data-index-in-node="47">Commit changes</b><span>.</span></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="3"><span>Spune-mi imediat ce ai apăsat acel buton,</span><span> pentru a face ultima setare de 1 minut din care obținem link-ul aplicației!</span></p></div></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="response-footer has-thoughts gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c3733613330="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-