</div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c3774178123-92"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c3774178123-92"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-92" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3774178123-92 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3774178123-92"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c622123267="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini a spus</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c2168670771=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2168670771="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c452521089="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" _nghost-ng-c2993282806="" id="message-content-id-r_3555dad5a0dad433" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2993282806="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_3555dad5a0dad433" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" style="--animation-duration: 900ms;"><span>Exact!</span><span class=""> Partea grozavă este că poți face orice modificare direct din GitHub,</span><span class=""> de pe orice calculator,</span><span> fără să mai folosești alte programe.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="1" style="--animation-duration: 416ms;"><span>Iată cum modifici codul direct pe site:</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><span>Intră pe pagina proiectului tău de pe GitHub (acolo unde vezi lista cu cele 5 fișiere încărcate).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><span>Dă click pe fișierul pe care vrei să-l modifici (de exemplu,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="61" class=""><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="61">index.html</code></b><span>).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><span>În colțul din dreapta sus al chenarului unde este afișat codul,</span><span> vei vedea o iconiță sub formă de </span><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="97">creion (✏️)</b><span>.</span><span> Apasă pe ea pentru a edita textul.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,3,0"><span>Fă modificările necesare în cod (de exemplu,</span><span> schimbă "Coleg 1",</span><span> "Coleg 2" cu numele reale ale colegilor tăi).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,4,0"><span>Când ai terminat,</span><span> apasă pe butonul verde </span><b data-path-to-node="2,4,0" data-index-in-node="41">Commit changes...</b><span> din dreapta sus,</span><span> apoi confirmă apăsând din nou </span><i data-path-to-node="2,4,0" data-index-in-node="106">Commit changes</i><span> în mica fereastră care se deschide.</span></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="3"><span>Orice modificare pe care o salvezi aici se va actualiza automat pe link-ul tău live în aproximativ 1-2 minute.</span><span> Va trebui doar să dai un refresh (reîncărcare) paginii pe telefon pentru a vedea noul cod în acțiune.</span></p></div></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="response-footer gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c3733613330="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c446528241="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c4215747216="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3774178123-92 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c2339029707-93 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2339029707=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2339029707="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c2339029707-93"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2339029707="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c2339029707-93 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c2339029707="" _nghost-ng-c4187370737="" class="ng-tns-c2339029707-93 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c4187370737="" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Răspuns bun" gemtooltip="Răspuns bun" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2527649141="" aria-describedby="cdk-descr