tainer ng-tns-c3774178123-107"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c3774178123-107"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c3774178123-107"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c3774178123-107" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3774178123="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c3774178123-107 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3774178123-107"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c622123267="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini a spus</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1188584280="" _nghost-ng-c2168670771=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2168670771="" class="model-response-text contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c452521089="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c452521089="" _nghost-ng-c2993282806="" id="message-content-id-r_55e7d6316c412b91" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2993282806="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_55e7d6316c412b91" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span>Perfect!</span><span> Ma bucur mult ca iti place.</span><span> Aceasta este iconita finala pe care o vei folosi.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="1"><span>Descarc-o pe calculatorul sau telefonul tau si amintește-ti sa o urci pe GitHub in proiectul tau ca </span><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="100" class=""><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="100">icon-192.png</code></b><span> si </span><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="116" class=""><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="116">icon-512.png</code></b><span> (folosind </span><i data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="139">Add file</i><span> -&gt; </span><i data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="151">Upload files</i><span>).</span></p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">🎉 Proiectul tău este oficial finalizat!</h3><p data-path-to-node="4"><span>Dupa ce ai pus si iconitele pe GitHub,</span><span> aplicatia este gata 100%.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Cum o puneti tu si colegii tai pe ecranul telefonului (ca pe o aplicatie normala):</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><span>Deschideti link-ul </span><code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="19">[https://gyorgymelissza-spec.github.io/magazie-pram/](https://gyorgymelissza-spec.github.io/magazie-pram/)</code><span> de pe telefon (folosind </span><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="150">Google Chrome</b><span> pe Android sau </span><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="179">Safari</b><span> pe iPhone)[cite:</span><span> 1.</span><span>1.</span><span>4,</span><span> 1.</span><span>1.</span><span>9].</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><span>Pe </span><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">Android (Chrome)</b><span>:</span><span> Apasati pe cele 3 puncte din dreapta sus si selectati </span><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="75">„Adaugă pe ecranul de pornire”</b><span> (sau </span><i data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="111">„Instalează aplicația”</i><span>)[cite:</span><span> 1.</span><span>1.</span><span>6,</span><span> 1.</span><span>1.</span><span>9].</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0"><span>Pe </span><b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="3">iPhone (Safari)</b><span>:</span><span> Apasati pe butonul de </span><i data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="42">Share</i><span> (patratul cu o sageata in sus de jos) si selectati </span><b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="99">„Adăugați pe ecranul principal”</b><span> (</span><i data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="132">Add to Home Screen</i><span>).</span></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="7"><span>O sa apara pe telefon iconita albastra cu casuta pe care tocmai am facut-o si o veti putea deschide direct de acolo!</span></p><p data-path-to-node="8"><span>Tot ce mai ai de facut acum este sa pui acelasi link intr-un generator gratuit de coduri QR de pe internet,</span><span> sa printezi codul QR si sa il pui pe usa magazinului sau a depozitului PRAM pentru ca orice coleg sa il poata scana si folosi rapid.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="9"><span>A fost o placere sa te ajut sa construiesti aceasta aplicatie de la zero!</span><span> Daca pe viitor mai ai nevoie de modificari la cod,</span><span> adaugari de functii sau alte imbunatatiri,</span><span class=""> stii unde ma gasesti.</span><span class=""> Mult succes tie si colegilor tai cu noua gestiune digitala!</span><span class=""> ⚡🏠📋</span></p><p data-path-to-node="10" style="--animation-duration: 878ms;"><span>*Iata iconita in varianta finala pregatita pentru descarcare:</span><span class="">*Arată minunat!</span><span class=""> O poți salva și folosi cu încredere.</span><span class=""> Mult succes cu noua aplicație!</span><span class=""> Să aveți spor la muncă și o magazie cât mai organizată!</span><span class=""> Let me know if you need any other help!</span></p><div class="attachment-container generated-images md-has-block-component"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><generated-image _nghost-ng-c2507059724="" class="luminous-layout ng-star-inserted" style="aspect-ratio: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507059724="" class="loader"></div><single-image _ngcontent-ng-c2507059724="" class="generated-image large luminous-layout" _nghost-ng-c2283638913="" jslog="185864;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl81NWU3ZDYzMTZjNDEyYjkxIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY183MzU0Yzc0NzMwZDQzZTNhIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true" data-is-interactive="false" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQiKwLahgKEwig88LaoMuXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQlgY" data-image-attachment-index="0"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283638913="" replace-fife-images-at-export="" class="image-container replace-fife-images-at-export ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283638913="" class="overlay-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283638913="" class="image-button ng-star-inserted" jslog="181501;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl81NWU3ZDYzMTZjNDEyYjkxIiwiY184Y2U5Y2RkNGE3YzRiMWMzIixudWxsLCJyY183MzU0Yzc0NzMwZDQzZTNhIixudWxsLG51bGwsInJvIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2283638913="" class="image animate loaded" alt=", generat de AI" src="blob:https://gemini.google.com/3f972b3f-443c-486e-9892-3a17223e9b9c"></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2507059724="" hide-from-message-actions="" overlay="" class="generated-image-controls hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----